                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A great game for a quick drop in, easy controls and a concept you can grasp almost instantly. I like it for when I have a bit of time and I need the quick stress relief of smoshing another player. It can get deliciously frantic with enough players in a session. Good fun and worth it.\n\nNo downside other than I let someone watch my session through steam and it pushed my ping so high I got kicked from the game. Not sure who's side of the fence that one lands on.",
